B.MS=s(["New Tile Token currency, obtained when fully clearing out a tile!","Tile Tokens can be sold at a 1 to 1 for gold by tapping the currency in the info bar.","Workshop and Tool Smith can no longer be upgraded while crafting.","Planks are now a tier one recipe in the Workshop.","Tool Smith now supports multiple workers (Lv 1 = 1 slot, Lv 2 = 2 slots), each with their own tool type and craft limit.","New research: Specialized Crafting \u2014 allows each Tool Smith worker to craft a different tool simultaneously (requires Lv 2 Tool Smith).","Workshop now supports multiple workers (Lv 1 = 1 slot, Lv 2 = 2 slots), each with their own recipe type and craft limit.","Forge now uses the same slot-based worker UI as the other crafting buildings.","Craft limit must now be selected when assigning a worker to any crafting building.","Workshop and toolsmith show the appropriate icons for what is being crafted.","Expanded Storage research is now repeatable: each level costs 1 more Tile Token and takes exponentially longer, granting +1 storage cap per resource per level.","Swift Scouts research is now repeatable: each level costs Tile Tokens (scaling) and gives +1% scouting speed per level.","Research Lab upgrade to 3 worker slots now costs 20 Wood, 25 Rock, 25 Planks, and 20 Iron Bars.","Trading Post now has 5 upgrade levels, each unlocking more resources to sell.","Trading Post Lv 1: Sticks, Berries, Rock. Lv 2: +Wood, Spores. Lv 3: +Stone Chunks, Planks. Lv 4: +Iron, Iron Bars. Lv 5: +Crystal.","Locked items are visible in the Trading Post menu so you can see what each upgrade unlocks.","Research progress card now shows total research time and estimated time to completion.","Research worker cards now show the % progress contributed per cycle."],t.s)
B.Uk=new A.a2("0.1.1+1",B.MS)
B.Nl=s(["Forge Building added.","The new Forge Building can craft Iron into Iron Bars.","Food Priority button added, find it next to the theme button at the top of the dashboard. (Unlocks upon discovering mushrooms)","Recipes in the Workshop and Tool Smith must be purchased before you can craft items.","New Weapon Mastery System introduced. Unlocks at Iron Tools.","Weapon Mastery gives you points to spend on various upgrades for each tool type.","Tool Smith and Workshop menus reworked.","Workshop no longer continues to produce when inventory is full."],t.s)
B.Un=new A.a2("0.1.1",B.Nl)
B.Ne=s(["The Research Lab's tile now displays an icon for the currently active research.","Icon display also extends to what's being crafted in the Workshop and Tool Smith","Bushes in the field now give sticks, which is the new requirement for crafting tools.","Wood can be broken down into sticks at the workshop at a 1 to 4 ratio.","Boulders now have a new icon and give a new stone chunks resource.","Stone Chunks can be broken down into stones at the Workshop at a 1 to 4 ratio.","New Hammer tool craftable in the Tool Smith. Required for workshop to break Stone Chunks into Stone.","Tool Smith and Workshop now display the requirements for a craft.","Dashboard expands dynamically based on game size.","Some Resources and Tiles have been renamed.","Wiki entries for Stone and Sticks now show recipes.","Hut and Workshop Wood requirements are now Sticks."],t.s)
B.TT=new A.a2("0.1.0+9",B.Ne)
B.Mv=s(["New Dashboard expand button!","Worker Interface changed.","Workshop worker equips a new tool when the current tool breaks.","Workshop has a craft menu now, which allows you to select what you are crafting.","Workshop and Tool Smith now have an input quantity option.","Every upgrade to the hut will now require 1 additional worker.","Areas now have a progressively higher cost to expand and now require an additional worker for every level.","Worker cards expanded in most menus."],t.s)
B.Uw=new A.a2("0.1.0+8",B.Mv)
B.O4=s(["In Game WIKI - Please provide feedback","When selecting a building that you can't afford you will now get an error message in the info bar.","Changed the temporary plank icon to a temporary plank emoji. (kinda made more sense)","Scouting an area now unassigns active workers on the game board.","Forest resources modified to: 50% trees, ~37% mushrooms, ~13% rock piles.","Workshop now costs 25 wood and 25 stone."],t.s)
B.Us=new A.a2("0.1.0+7",B.O4)
B.M8=s(["Areas that have adaptive foraging and/or auto-scout will now display an icon on the bottom right of the board grid.","Worker cards now display information when a worker is upgrading a building","Efficient harvesting is now more of an incremental upgrade","When a worker axe/pick breaks you will get the last harvested material now.","New Researchable for every tile that increases the max cycles.","New Saw tool for processing wood into planks",'New "Workshop" building that processes various materials requiring a worker.',"Time is now displayed in the Area Board upgrade dialogue"],t.s)
B.Up=new A.a2("0.1.0+6",B.M8)
B.LA=s(["Themes added!","Storehouses can now be upgraded to level 3, giving a +20 to all resources for every level.","Better area size upgrade dialogue.","Better research and Tool Smith menu UX","Houses can be upgraded to level 4, granting one additional worker per level.","Upgrading area size now requires worker and takes time."],t.s)
B.Ui=new A.a2("0.1.0+5",B.LA)
B.NZ=s(["Buildings now take time to construct and require a worker","Buildings on the homeboard can now be dragged to move","Reduced the cost of the first upgrade to the area boards","Stat tracking system added. Find the button in the dashboard!"],t.s)
B.TR=new A.a2("0.1.0+4",B.NZ)
B.NY=s(["Research building added","Max 3 Research buildings",u.X,"auto-scout","Many more upgrades!","Research is time based, it will advance while you are offline."],t.s)
B.U1=new A.a2("0.1.0+3",B.NY)
